# Requests for corpus/shadow-mock (VS Code REST Client: humao.rest-client).
# Start the mock with: shadowmock --root corpus/shadow-mock
# In SaaS, set @base to https://shadowmock.kaizentis.xyz/<org-handle> and add
#   Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# to every /__admin request.
@base = http://localhost:8080

########## Call-count responses ##########

### Reset all counters first
POST {{base}}/__admin/counters/reset

### Retry: send this 3 times → 503, 503, then 200 SETTLED
POST {{base}}/sm/calls/payments

### Polling: send 4 times → PENDING ×3, then COMPLETE
GET {{base}}/sm/calls/jobs/7

### Flaky: every 3rd call → 502
GET {{base}}/sm/calls/flaky

### Rule order: 7 calls → 200,200,418,200,429,500,429
GET {{base}}/sm/calls/order

### Call number in a template → {"attempt": "n"}
GET {{base}}/sm/calls/attempt

### Counters: list
GET {{base}}/__admin/counters

### Counters: jump to call 9, so the next call is the 10th → 500
PUT {{base}}/__admin/counters/5d010001-5001-4000-8000-000000000011
Content-Type: application/json

< ./shadow-mock/sessions/counters/set-counter.json

###
GET {{base}}/sm/calls/tenth

########## Gzip ##########

### Compressed (Content-Encoding: gzip)
GET {{base}}/sm/gzip/claims
Accept-Encoding: gzip

### gzipDisabled → no Content-Encoding
GET {{base}}/sm/gzip/claims-uncompressed
Accept-Encoding: gzip

########## Key-based shadow mock ##########

### Create a session with tokens and mappings
# @name declined
POST {{base}}/__admin/sessions/key-based
Content-Type: application/json

< ./shadow-mock/sessions/key-based/02-checkout-declined.json

### With the key in the designated header → 402 card_declined (session)
POST {{base}}/sm/payments
X-Shadow-Mock-Key: {{declined.response.body.$.key}}

### Without the key → 200 SETTLED (global)
POST {{base}}/sm/payments

### Key only inside the body (scan) → 402
POST {{base}}/sm/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "testRun": "{{declined.response.body.$.key}}", "amount": 10 }

### Match token in the body, no key at all → DECLINE (session)
POST {{base}}/sm/credit-check
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "CUST-99812", "amount": 500 }

### Not mocked by the session → falls through to global
GET {{base}}/sm/customers/C-1
X-Shadow-Mock-Key: {{declined.response.body.$.key}}

### Add a session mapping that fails twice (per-session counters)
POST {{base}}/__admin/sessions/{{declined.response.body.$.id}}/mappings
Content-Type: application/json

< ./shadow-mock/sessions/key-based/06-session-mapping-with-call-counts.json

### Session journal: count POST /sm/payments
POST {{base}}/__admin/sessions/{{declined.response.body.$.id}}/requests/count
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "POST", "urlPath": "/sm/payments" }

### Session counters
GET {{base}}/__admin/sessions/{{declined.response.body.$.id}}/counters

### Override a session file
PUT {{base}}/__admin/sessions/{{declined.response.body.$.id}}/files/session/claim-from-file.json
Content-Type: application/json

< ./shadow-mock/sessions/files/claim-from-file.json

### Add a token, then extend and add a mask
PATCH {{base}}/__admin/sessions/{{declined.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./shadow-mock/sessions/key-based/patch-add-tokens.json

###
PATCH {{base}}/__admin/sessions/{{declined.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./shadow-mock/sessions/key-based/patch-add-masks-and-extend.json

### Keepalive
POST {{base}}/__admin/sessions/{{declined.response.body.$.id}}/keepalive

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/__admin/sessions/{{declined.response.body.$.id}}

########## Override by id and masks ##########

### Create the override session
# @name override
POST {{base}}/__admin/sessions/key-based
Content-Type: application/json

< ./shadow-mock/sessions/key-based/03-override-by-id.json

### Non-VIP body: override hides global even though it does not match → 404
POST {{base}}/sm/payments
X-Shadow-Mock-Key: {{override.response.body.$.key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tier": "standard" }

### Masks session
# @name masked
POST {{base}}/__admin/sessions/key-based
Content-Type: application/json

< ./shadow-mock/sessions/key-based/04-masks.json

### Masked specific rate → global catch-all answers
GET {{base}}/sm/fx/rates
X-Shadow-Mock-Key: {{masked.response.body.$.key}}

########## URL-based shadow mock ##########

### Create a 30-day CI mock
# @name ci
POST {{base}}/__admin/sessions/url-based
Content-Type: application/json

< ./shadow-mock/sessions/url-based/02-claims-api-ci.json

### Through the URL insert → lapsed policy (url-based)
GET {{ci.response.body.$.baseUrl}}/sm/policies/9

### Not mocked → global policy
GET {{ci.response.body.$.baseUrl}}/sm/policies/10

### First call times out (504 after 2 s), then 200
POST {{ci.response.body.$.baseUrl}}/sm/fraud/score

### Nested key-based inside the URL-based mock (inline version of sessions/url-based/03-nested-key-based.json)
POST {{base}}/__admin/sessions/key-based
Content-Type: application/json

{ "parentId": "{{ci.response.body.$.id}}", "ttlSeconds": 600, "mappings": [ { "request": { "method": "GET", "urlPath": "/sm/policies/9" }, "response": { "status": 200, "jsonBody": { "active": true, "source": "nested" } } } ] }

### Unknown URL-based id → 404 unknown_url_based_mock
GET {{base}}/d/aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa/sm/policies/9

########## Runtime ##########

### Validate a mapping
POST {{base}}/__admin/mappings/validate
Content-Type: application/json

< ./shadow-mock/sessions/runtime/validate-mapping.json

### Negative: scenario fields are rejected → 422 scenarios_not_supported
POST {{base}}/__admin/sessions/{{ci.response.body.$.id}}/mappings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scenarioName": "flow", "request": { "urlPath": "/sm/neg" }, "response": { "status": 200 } }
